  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Buntu Foods Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project entails to enhance the capacity of Buntu foods by strengthening their internal controls and establishment of policies and procedures, purchase capacity, and enterprise planning. Smallholder farmers&apos; production capacity will be improved by increased access to inputs.</narrative>
